1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:02,493
Know the business you invest in.

2
00:00:02,493 --> 00:00:15,640
BlockID Business Passport gives every shareholder, large or small, a live view of the business they own: updates and valuations analysed by AI and approved by people, a share register on blockchain as proof of ownership, and dividends paid straight to their wallet.

3
00:00:16,494 --> 00:00:18,437
It works today on testnet.

4
00:00:18,437 --> 00:00:21,289
Open the site: no sign-up, no wallet.

5
00:00:21,289 --> 00:00:24,550
You land in a demo investor account, with sample data.

6
00:00:25,406 --> 00:00:26,849
Why does this matter?

7
00:00:26,849 --> 00:00:29,371
Investing in a business is hard to follow.

8
00:00:29,371 --> 00:00:31,303
The numbers are hard to trust.

9
00:00:31,303 --> 00:00:35,553
After you invest, you lose sight of sales, profit and new shares.

10
00:00:35,553 --> 00:00:39,610
Ownership sits in a spreadsheet, so your stake can shrink and nobody tells you.

11
00:00:39,610 --> 00:00:42,281
And dividends are slow, or never arrive.

12
00:00:42,281 --> 00:00:46,440
Good businesses struggle to raise money, and problems surface too late to fix.

13
00:00:47,302 --> 00:00:49,642
So we built one passport per business.

14
00:00:49,642 --> 00:00:54,938
Every investor can understand it, follow it, own it, get paid, and check it for themselves.

15
00:00:55,806 --> 00:00:56,931
Understand it.

16
00:00:56,931 --> 00:01:03,340
Paste a website and get a plain report in minutes: a business score from A to E, and a low, mid and high value.

17
00:01:03,340 --> 00:01:05,260
Every figure links to its source.

18
00:01:05,260 --> 00:01:07,158
No source, no number.

19
00:01:07,158 --> 00:01:09,931
And a person approves it before anyone sees it.

20
00:01:10,790 --> 00:01:16,119
Behind the report, AI agents read the website, find competitors and analyse the market.

21
00:01:16,119 --> 00:01:19,403
A finding that cites a page the agent never fetched is dropped.

22
00:01:19,403 --> 00:01:21,267
The agents hold no keys.

23
00:01:21,267 --> 00:01:22,971
They can only propose.

24
00:01:23,830 --> 00:01:24,636
Own it.

25
00:01:24,636 --> 00:01:30,909
Every holder, wallet and share count sits in one share register on blockchain, copied to Ethereum and HashKey Chain.

26
00:01:30,909 --> 00:01:35,182
New shares need a person's approval, and investors see the dilution first.

27
00:01:36,030 --> 00:01:40,995
This is a sample listing for Airwallex, built from public information, on our test network.

28
00:01:40,995 --> 00:01:44,939
Fifteen holders, read straight from the chain, not from a spreadsheet.

29
00:01:45,806 --> 00:01:47,703
Follow it, and get paid.

30
00:01:47,703 --> 00:01:52,112
The business shares its numbers, weekly, monthly, quarterly or yearly.

31
00:01:52,112 --> 00:01:58,249
The draft flags risks from the numbers, a person approves it, and every investor gets the same update at the same time.

32
00:01:58,249 --> 00:02:00,408
A dividend rule is approved once.

33
00:02:00,408 --> 00:02:05,226
After twenty-four hours to cancel, it is paid to every wallet, with no fees for holders.

34
00:02:06,070 --> 00:02:06,945
Check it.

35
00:02:06,945 --> 00:02:08,160
Don't trust us.

36
00:02:08,160 --> 00:02:12,251
Your browser hashes the report and compares it with the record on three blockchains.

37
00:02:12,251 --> 00:02:14,706
Change one number, and it turns red.

38
00:02:15,558 --> 00:02:18,671
Under the hood, only approved actions reach the chain.

39
00:02:18,671 --> 00:02:21,058
AI analysis runs with no keys.

40
00:02:21,058 --> 00:02:23,376
An admin wallet signs one approval.

41
00:02:23,376 --> 00:02:27,637
Only then does the isolated issuer, the only part with a key, act.

42
00:02:27,637 --> 00:02:31,342
Our AgentProvenance contract records who proposed and who approved.

43
00:02:31,342 --> 00:02:32,705
Agents propose.

44
00:02:32,705 --> 00:02:33,951
Humans approve.

45
00:02:33,951 --> 00:02:35,251
Chains prove.

46
00:02:36,110 --> 00:02:41,269
The whole flow works on testnet today, with fourteen sample listings built from public information.

47
00:02:41,269 --> 00:02:43,212
We have no real users yet.

48
00:02:43,212 --> 00:02:48,087
Next: our first pilot businesses, investor communities and licensed partners.

49
00:02:48,087 --> 00:02:53,507
Businesses will pay a listing fee, a register subscription, and small transfer and dividend fees.

50
00:02:53,507 --> 00:02:56,019
Try it at eth dot blockid dot au.
